@startuml seq_submit_workload
title Sequence — Workload Entry and the Hybrid KPI Engine

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam sequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam actorBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam actorBorderColor #808080
skinparam participantBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam participantBorderColor #808080
skinparam databaseBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam databaseBorderColor #808080
skinparam sequenceGroupBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam sequenceGroupBorderColor #808080
skinparam sequenceReferenceBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam sequenceParticipantBorderColor #808080
skinparam sequenceLifeLineBorderColor #AAAAAA
skinparam ArrowColor #333333
skinparam noteBorderColor #AAAAAA
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FAFAFA
autonumber

actor "Developer" as D
actor "Project Manager" as PM
participant "Frontend" as SPA
participant "ActualWorkloadService" as WS
participant "KpiService" as KPI
database "PostgreSQL" as DB

== 1. Monthly entry (Developer) ==
D -> SPA : enter days for the month
SPA -> WS : POST /actual-workload
WS -> WS : own workload only,\nactive team member
WS -> DB : INSERT actual_workload
WS --> SPA : 201 Created

== 2. KPI consultation (computed at read time) ==
PM -> SPA : open the KPI tab
SPA -> KPI : GET /api/projects/{id}/kpi
KPI -> DB : workload, plan, year's TCC,\ninvoiced milestones, deliverables, Internal Quote
KPI -> KPI : EV %, Delivery %, drift days,\nproduction revenue, unbilled revenue, EAC, margins
KPI --> SPA : KpiResponse (nothing written)

== 3. Monthly review (frozen snapshot) ==
PM -> SPA : enter EV % + highlights
SPA -> KPI : POST /kpi/snapshots
KPI -> DB : INSERT kpi_snapshot (immutable)
KPI --> SPA : 201 — review frozen

note over KPI, DB
  Hybrid engine: live KPIs are recomputed on every read; the snapshot freezes the official state of the monthly review.
end note

@enduml
